            <ArticleTitle>Balloon-assisted retrieval of a broken stent-delivery system.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>644-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The breakage of a stent-delivery catheter at the shaft is a rare and dangerous complication during coronary intervention. We report a simple balloon technique for the successful retrieval, from within a guiding catheter, of both an unexpanded stent and its delivery system.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
